387	 * no pet-state change, no page switch, no approval, no scroll — and the agent
388	 * idle (s_last_pet_state==0), fade the foreground over to a dim digital clock
389	 * (standby_view).  Any of those activity points calls ui_activity_reset(),
390	 * which both restarts the countdown and (if the clock is up) fades it away,
391	 * restoring the screen that was up before standby.  The idle pet↔particle
